sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor D as Driver
  participant A as Vehicle agent
  participant G as Allow(q)
  participant M as MHS
  participant J as Journal
  D->>A: "What is the coolant temperature?"
  A->>G: read(coolant temperature)
  G->>M: evidence age?
  M-->>G: last value older than its bound
  G-->>A: refuse · STALE_EVIDENCE
  G->>J: refused · STALE_EVIDENCE
  A-->>D: "I could not read the coolant temperature — the reading is too old."
  Note over A: An old number is never presented as current.
